    <briefdescription>
<para>Release-gate benchmarks for metadata consistency and lineage hot paths. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Covers the Phase D roadmap item: &quot;broaden benchmark depth beyond cache-centric metadata hot paths&quot;</para>
<para>Gates: GATE-MCL-01 <ref refid="structthemis_1_1_consistency_issue_1a87279003e5d5fe98e5253796e55ec357" kindref="member">ConsistencyIssue::toJSON()</ref> ≥ 10M ops/s GATE-MCL-02 <ref refid="structthemis_1_1metadata_1_1_column_ref_1a5f21f16e59e39b3d454d41be8a2b803e" kindref="member">ColumnRef::toString()</ref> ≥ 50M ops/s GATE-MCL-03 <ref refid="structthemis_1_1metadata_1_1_column_ref" kindref="compound">ColumnRef</ref> JSON round-trip ≥ 5M ops/s GATE-MCL-04 <ref refid="namespacethemis_1_1metadata_1aae7ca3e7a55cd13ba52c35097bc8b085" kindref="member">TransformationType</ref> string ≥ 20M ops/s</para>
<para>Benchmark hygiene (benchmarks/MEASUREMENT_HYGIENE.md):<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>kCanonicalRngSeed = 42</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>No I/O; CPU-only benchmarks use default clock</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Repetitions(5) + ReportAggregatesOnly(true) for stable statistics </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
